{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36575","headline":"暇日有寄姑苏曹使君兼呈张郎中郡中宾僚 · 罗隐","name":"暇日有寄姑苏曹使君兼呈张郎中郡中宾僚","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"嘉植阴阴覆劒池，此中能政动神祗。\n湖边观稼雨迎马，城外犒军风满旗。\n融酒徒夸无算爵，俭莲还少最高枝。\n珊瑚笔架真珠履，曾和陈王几首诗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36575.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36575","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}